{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルが終わり心寂しくはありますが、私はこのプリンシパルで少しは大きくなれたかなぁ、、と思います。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありのままの自分をさらけ出す、可愛いなんていらない、来てくれる方にいかに楽しんでもらえるか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメディだけあって好きな分野なので、色んな私、みんなを見られたのではないかと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お芝居は楽しい、でもその分難しく、考えることもありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果、みんな笑顔で幕を閉じれたのでよかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22公演ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルが終わってから、毎日いろんなことがあったよ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多いと思うけど...写真付きで書いてくね！ついてくるんだぞ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/06/27/9480296/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MJ収録。ブルー衣装達"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/06/27/9480296/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"増えたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.